{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isDoor"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/item\/isdoor"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isDoor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks"]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either the map says so, by hanging a way through on the thing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"hall.north(garden, via: frontDoor)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), or the item declares "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/door","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The first covers every door a player can walk through, which is why most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"games never declare the second.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It answers the same for every room, which is deliberate. A rule that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wants “a door ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"here"}]},{"text":"” — the one the player could walk through from where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they stand — wants the room’s exits, not this. What this is for is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"question a verb asks about the thing in front of it: knocking on a door","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is a different act from knocking on a bench, wherever either is standing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"True if this item is a door — the front door, the trap door, the grating.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isDoor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV6isDoorSbvp","title":"isDoor","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item"]]},"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Item/isDoor":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isDoor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/item\/isdoor","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"True if this item is a door — the front door, the trap door, the grating.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isDoor","title":"isDoor","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/ContainersDoorsAndLocks":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Containers, Doors, and Locks","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Hold things, open and close, lock with keys, and gate the map."}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/containersdoorsandlocks","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/door":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"door"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preci